\begin_inset Formula $h_{x}$
\end_inset
), 
\begin_inset Formula $n_{y}$
\end_inset
 across the width and 
\begin_inset Formula $n_{z}$
\end_inset
 through the thickness. Table 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "tab:convergence"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"

\end_inset
 gives the first three bending frequencies for three meshes.
\end_layout

