\begin_layout Subsection
Analytical references: exact Euler-Bernoulli and Rayleigh-Ritz
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Two semi-analytical methods are kept beside the finite elements. The exact Euler-Bernoulli solution of a piecewise-uniform beam is obtained with transfer matrices 
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
after ""
before ""
key "pestel1963"
literal "true"

\end_inset
