Two remarks on what the plan cannot see. In this network the push and the draw give the same growth rates, because the chain is symmetric; the model does not distinguish the inner tongue, inside the cell, from the outer one. And the position of the slot on the plate is centred by default, with the tip of the tongue neither towards the hole nor towards the bottom: a dimension to measure.
